*start_scene_1
; Scene 1: 放課後の帰り道
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="street_evening.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_daily.mp3"]

After school.[l][er]

Two of my classmates were laughing outside the convenience store.[l][er]

#男子A
So? Did you actually get a girlfriend or what?[l][er]

#男子B
I did. At the café by the station. She asked ME—[l][er]

I walked past them without a word.[l][er]

#protagonist
(...)[l][er]

Same road every day.[l][er]
Same me every day.[l][er]

Lately, the fifteen-minute walk home feels a little longer each time.[l][er]

#protagonist
(A girlfriend, huh...)[l][er]

I repeated it in my head, then shook it off.[l][er]

"I want a girlfriend"—it's not as light a thing as it sounds when you say it.[l][er]
Because what I really want is something more—[l][er]

#protagonist
(...)[l][er]

I can't put it into words.[l][er]
That's why I've never told anyone.[l][er]

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_2
; Scene 2: 悪魔との遭遇
; ================================================================================

[playbgm storage="bgm_devil.mp3"]

#？？？
Say it out loud.[l][er]

—A voice.[l][er]

Not inside my ears. Not from behind me.[l][er]
It came from just one step outside my own head.[l][er]

#protagonist
...Huh?[l][er]

I turned around.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

—There it was.[l][er]

Something like a cat.[l][er]

But its eyes were level with mine.[l][er]
A cat isn't that tall.[l][er]

#akuma
Hey there.[l][er]

#protagonist
...What are you?[l][er]

#akuma
Just passing by.[l][er]

#akuma
Just a devil, passing by.[l][er]

The corners of its mouth rose, like a human's.[l][er]
A cat's face isn't supposed to bend that far.[l][er]

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_3
; Scene 3: 7人の存在
; ================================================================================

#akuma
Hey.[l][er]

#akuma
You couldn't say it just now, could you?[l][er]

#protagonist
...What are you talking about.[l][er]

#akuma
The part that comes after "I want a girlfriend."[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#akuma
You don't have to say it. In exchange, I'll tell you one thing.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
The number of girls who like you right now is—seven.[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#protagonist
...Huh?[l][er]

#akuma
It's true.[l][er]

#akuma
Really, really true.[l][er]

#protagonist
You're joking.[l][er]

#akuma
You just thought, "There's no way."[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#akuma
That's proof number one.[l][er]

I couldn't say anything.[l][er]

"There's no way."[l][er]
—I really did think that.[l][er]
Not seven. I don't feel like even one person likes me.[l][er]

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_4
; Scene 4: 理想の彼女
; ================================================================================

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
Now, the main topic.[l][er]

#protagonist
...The main topic.[l][er]

#akuma
Out of those seven, not one is close to your "type."[l][er]

#protagonist
...How would I know.[l][er]

#akuma
So I thought I'd bring them a little closer.[l][er]

#protagonist
...Huh?[l][er]

#akuma
Will you tell me? Your type.[l][er]

#protagonist
No.[l][er]

#akuma
Hmm.[l][er]

#akuma
Then I'll say it for you.[l][er]

—In that instant, its voice changed.[l][er]

#akuma
"A girl with muscles."[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#protagonist
Th-That's not—[l][er]

#akuma
It is.[l][er]

#akuma
You said it in your heart a moment ago.[l][er]

—I did.[l][er]

The part after "I want a girlfriend."[l][er]
The one line I'd never told anyone, the one I didn't even want to admit to myself—[l][er]
I'd thought it. Clearly.[l][er]

#protagonist
...You.[l][er]

#akuma
Yep.[l][er]

#akuma
That's perfectly normal, you know.[l][er]

#akuma
You just can't believe it's normal.[l][er]

—It's not normal.[l][er]
I know it's not normal. That's why I can't tell anyone.[l][er]
That's why I kept it pushed down all this time.[l][er]

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_5
; Scene 5: 契約
; ================================================================================

[chara_show name="akuma" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
So, you see.[l][er]

#akuma
I thought I'd give the seven of them a potion.[l][er]

#protagonist
...A potion.[l][er]

#akuma
A potion that brings them closer to your "type" if they drink it.[l][er]

#protagonist
Wait.[l][er]

#akuma
Whether they drink it is up to each of them.[l][er]

#protagonist
I said wait.[l][er]

#akuma
I'm listening.[l][er]

#protagonist
...I didn't ask for this.[l][er]

#akuma
Sure you did.[l][er]

#akuma
In your heart. This whole time.[l][er]

—The pit of my stomach went cold.[l][er]

#protagonist
Something like that isn't—[l][er]

#akuma
If "something like that" could be brushed off, nobody would need devils.[l][er]

No words came out.[l][er]

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_6
; Scene 6: 対価
; ================================================================================

#protagonist
...What's the price?[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
Sharp.[l][er]

#akuma
Me? I eat human emotions.[l][er]

#protagonist
...Emotions.[l][er]

#akuma
There's one kind I like best.[l][er]

#akuma
—When "I want to become the type the person I love likes" and "but I can never go back" live in the same heart at the same time—[l][er]

#akuma
—that flavor.[l][er]

The devil smiled.[l][er]

It smiled, but its face was twisted, just slightly.[l][er]
By something other than "happy."[l][er]

#protagonist
...You.[l][er]

#akuma
Yep.[l][er]

#akuma
You just thought, "That's the worst."[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#akuma
I eat that too.[l][er]

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_7
; Scene 7: 悪魔の退場
; ================================================================================

[chara_show name="akuma" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
Bye now.[l][er]

#protagonist
Hey—[l][er]

#akuma
The contract's already been made.[l][er]

#protagonist
No, it hasn't.[l][er]

#akuma
Yes, it has.[l][er]

#akuma
The moment you never once said out loud, "This is absolutely not okay."[l][er]

—That's right.[l][er]

Not once did I say,[l][er]
"Stop,"[l][er]
or "I don't want this."[l][er]
I never said it.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]

The devil vanished.[l][er]

A streetlight flickered.[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#protagonist
...Damn it.[l][er]

I ran all the way home.[l][er]
Even though running wouldn't let me catch up to anything anymore.[l][er]

